    "homeType": "CONDO",
    "description": "Welcome to 1822 Lyon Street, a modern interpretation of a stately Victorian. This newly formed condominium in Pacific Heights was transformed in 2020 into a peaceful retreat. The home sits at garden level with direct access to a deck and sunny, shared yard. The fully modernized interior comprises two bedrooms, both with en-suite bathrooms, as well as a powder room for guests. An open entertaining space flows directly to the deck and shared yard through grand sliding glass doors offering true indoor-outdoor living. State-of-the-art sound dampening was installed throughout the ceiling creating a serene living experience. The lovely galley kitchen is the perfect place to prepare meals with a Bosch appliance suite, Zephyr wine refrigerator and built-in espresso machine. Designer finishes, newer systems, Doorbird and Nest integration, Hansgrohe water fixtures, central air conditioning and heat, and in-unit laundry complete the living experience. Leased, secure parking is available nearby (buyer to investigate). Located steps from some of the best food and shopping, 1822 Lyon sits at the crossroads of Pacific Heights, Presidio Heights and Laurel Village. This elegant home offers a wonderful sanctuary in the city that you should see for yourself."
  },
